phase2.explanation:
You need to use `#[tokio::main]` to run async code in main.

**The fix:**
```rust
#[tokio::main]
async fn main() {
    let result = hello().await;
}
```

**Rust-chan says:**
"Use `#[tokio::main]` to make main async."
